### Payment Service - REST Client test file

# @base = http://localhost:3003
@base = https://payment-service-p23n.onrender.com
@userId = REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID
@bookingId = REPLACE_WITH_BOOKING_ID
@paymentId = REPLACE_WITH_PAYMENT_ID

### Process a payment (daytime, 2 passengers, Premium, no discount)
### totalPrice = baseFare(10) × cabMult(1.2) × daytimeMult(1) × passMult(1) × discount(1) = 12.00
POST {{base}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "{{bookingId}}",
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "baseFare": 10,
  "cabType": "Premium",
  "passengers": 2,
  "bookingDateTime": "2026-05-10T14:00:00.000Z",
  "hasDiscount": false
}

###

### Process a payment with nighttime rate and 5 passengers (Executive, with discount)
### totalPrice = baseFare(10) × cabMult(1.4) × daytimeMult(1.2) × passMult(2) × discount(0.9) = 30.24
POST {{base}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "{{bookingId}}",
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "baseFare": 10,
  "cabType": "Executive",
  "passengers": 5,
  "bookingDateTime": "2026-05-10T03:00:00.000Z",
  "hasDiscount": true
}

###

### Get a single payment by ID
GET {{base}}/payments/{{paymentId}}

###

### Get all payments for a user
GET {{base}}/payments/user/{{userId}}
